ess":0.9111529588699341,"text_excerpt":"No cover to get in, you gotta leave your hand grenades outside though. I wandered in here while walking Bourbin of course and I had a blast! I've been to dueling piano joints before, even a Howl at the Moon here in Houston, but this place was just a bit more fun, maybe because you're a lot more drunk. Either way, for a free (or for tips), good time come in and enjoy the show!"}],"visual":[]},"notebook_case":null}
